     but range EPISODES lengthen 2.5x, 26 -> 64 bars, while its
     share barely moves. That is the answer to "a three-month range is
     a stronger chop reading": the long window does not find MORE chop,
     it finds the SAME chop in longer, readable episodes. Trending
     grows and drifting is what it takes from.

