4. CROSS-PAIR. First the trap, measured rather than assumed.
  leg proxy built from every OTHER pair, lag 0 correlation: +1.0000
  that is an identity, not a finding: 28 pairs from 8 currencies is a
  rank-7 panel, so EURGBP minus USDGBP IS EURUSD. No exclusion rule
  fixes it, and a contemporaneous cross-pair reading is vacuous here.
  the same proxy at non-zero lags: -5:-0.029  -4:-0.000  -3:-0.014  -2:-0.004  -1:-0.004  +1:-0.004  +2:-0.004  +3:-0.014  +4:-0.000  +5:-0.029

